ith north at the top of the map).", "Remember: **N**ever **E**at **S**oggy **W**affles, clockwise from north."]}, {"k": "idea", "t": "Position on a grid", "p": ["Describe a position by counting **across**, then **up**: the palm tree is at (1, 1). 3 east and 2 north → **(4, 3)**."], "fig": {"kind": "coord", "x": [0, 6], "y": [0, 5], "points": [{"x": 1, "y": 1, "l": "palm"}, {"x": 4, "y": 3, "l": "X"}]}}, {"k": "try", "t": "Direction", "p": [], "qq": {"id": "m3u14s2t02", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Moving to the right on the map is…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "north", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "east", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "south", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "west", "ok": false, "fb": ""}], "fixed": true}}, {"k": "method", "t": "How do I describe position and movement?", "p": ["Step 1: North up, south down, east right, west left.", "Step 2: Count the squares moved in each direction.", "Step 3: Position: across, then up.", "Step 4: Describe moves: '3 east, 2 north'."]}, {"k": "example", "t": "Move", "p": [], "q": "From (2, 2), go 3 north.", "steps": [["up 3", ""]], "a": "(2, 5)"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Move", "p": [], "q": "From (5, 4), go 2 west.", "steps": [["left 2", ""]], "a": "(3, 4)"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Describe", "p": [], "q": "From (1, 1) to (1, 4).", "steps": [["up 3", ""]], "a": "3 north"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Turn", "p": [], "q": "Facing north, quarter turn clockwise.", "steps": [["N → E", ""]], "a": "facing east"}, {"k": "try", "t": "Turn", "p": [], "qq": {"id": "m3u14s2t03", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Facing east, quarter turn clockwise. Now facing…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "north", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "east", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "south", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "west", "ok": false, "fb": ""}], "fixed": true}}, {"k": "error", "t": "Mixing east and west", "p": ["Find the first wrong line."], "q": "Move right 2 squares on the map.", "lines": ["2 west"], "bad": 0, "why": "Right is east: 2 east.", "fix": [["2 east", ""]], "id": "m3u14s2t04"}, {"k": "mistake", "t": "Mixing up east and west", "p": ["Clockwise from north: N, E, S, W."]}, {"k": "tip", "t": "Real life", "p": ["Maps, compasses, video-game characters and robot toys use directions."]}, {"k": "summary", "t": "What to remember", "p": ["N up, E right, S down, W left.", "Position: across then up.", "Describe moves by squares and direction."]}], "video": {"src": null, "offset": 0, "dur": 660, "range": ""}, "stops": [{"id": "14.2-k1", "t": 1, "after": 0, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m3u14s2k01", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Before you read on: is the pirate further east?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "yes", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "no", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}}, {"id": "14.2-k2", "t": 2, "after": 4, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m3u14s2k02", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Down the map is…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "north", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "east", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "south", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "west", "ok": false, "fb": ""}], "fixed": true}}, {"id": "14.2-k3", "t": 3, "after": 9, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m3u14s2k03", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "From (2, 2), 3 north is…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "(2, 5)", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "(5, 2)", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}}, {"id": "14.2-k4", "t": 4, "after": 14, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m3u14s2k04", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Quick check: right on the map is…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "north", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, {"t": "east", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "south", "ok": false, "fb": ""}, 